@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title Excuse Me - State Diagram

[*] --> Unauthenticated : app opened

Unauthenticated --> Authenticating : sign up / log in
Authenticating --> EditingInput : authentication success
Authenticating --> Unauthenticated : authentication failed

EditingInput --> EditingInput : update truth / style
EditingInput --> Generating : submit request

Generating --> ResultShown : generation success
Generating --> ErrorState : validation or network error

ErrorState --> EditingInput : retry
ResultShown --> EditingInput : regenerate
ResultShown --> Publishing : publish to wall

Publishing --> ResultShown : publish success
Publishing --> ErrorState : publish failed

EditingInput --> Unauthenticated : log out
ResultShown --> Unauthenticated : log out

Unauthenticated : User has no valid session
EditingInput : Truth and style are being prepared
Generating : Request is processed by backend
ResultShown : Generated excuse is displayed
Publishing : Result is posted to public wall
ErrorState : Operation failed
@enduml
